WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:14.900
We will add a steel water bottle, record 24 bottles in stock, then sell two
for INR 250 each.

00:15.000 --> 00:24.900
Choose Set up my business, then a sign-in option. After sign-in, enter your
business name and workspace address.

00:25.000 --> 00:34.900
In Company Setup, enter your business name, address, phone and email.
Display Name is the name customers see.

00:35.000 --> 00:44.900
Off: sales documents have no GST. On: GST applies and GSTIN is needed. This
sample shop is not GST-registered, so we use Off.

00:45.000 --> 00:54.900
Open the three-line menu. Product Inventory is for items, Billing is for
sales bills, and Dashboard is for a quick business check.

00:55.000 --> 01:04.900
Open Product Inventory, then choose Add Product. A product is one of the
things you sell.

01:05.000 --> 01:14.900
Product Name: Steel water bottle. SKU: BOTTLE-01. SKU is your own short
item code. Use a name you will recognise.

01:15.000 --> 01:24.900
Choose or type the brand and category. HSN / SAC groups products for tax.
Select a matching saved code when needed.

01:25.000 --> 01:34.900
Choose Keep catalog price. Enter 250 in Catalog Price (INR). This is the
catalogue selling price, not your supplier's buying price.

01:35.000 --> 01:44.900
Choose a Product Image file, or enter its image URL. Check the preview. Use
PNG, JPEG or WebP under 1 MB.

01:45.000 --> 01:54.900
Keep Active selected. Review the details, then choose Save Product. Adding
a product does not add physical stock; that comes next.

01:55.000 --> 02:04.900
Owned Stock: select your store and Stock In. Quantity: 24. Reason: Opening
stock. Choose Record Stock Movement once.

02:05.000 --> 02:14.900
Choose Bulk Excel, then Products and Download products template. Fill the
Data sheet in Excel. The README sheet explains each column.

02:15.000 --> 02:24.900
Web pictures: use public HTTPS links in image_url. Local files: use
image_file filenames, then ZIP manifest.xlsx with its images folder.

02:25.000 --> 02:39.900
Choose your file, then Upload & process. Download results: success.xlsx
lists saved rows; failure.xlsx explains errors. Fix only failed rows.
Resume an interrupted import rather than starting again.

02:40.000 --> 02:49.900
Open Billing. Choose Sales invoice and the billing store. Find your
customer, or choose Add customer here to enter a new one.

02:50.000 --> 02:59.900
Set the invoice date and Bill To Address. Place of Supply is the sale's
state. Keep Ship to billing address checked for the same delivery address.

03:00.000 --> 03:09.900
Select Steel water bottle from Product / Inventory. Quantity: 2. Price:
250. Use Add Item for another product on the same bill.

03:10.000 --> 03:19.900
Check the total: 2 bottles x INR 250 = INR 500. This sample shop has no
GST. Check your own bill's tax too.

03:20.000 --> 03:29.900
The customer pays INR 300. Enter Amount Received Now: 300, Payment Mode:
cash, and Received In Account: Shop cash. INR 200 remains due.

03:30.000 --> 03:44.900
Keep Auto-create receivable for unpaid balance checked: this tracks the INR
200 still owed. Review the bill, choose Post Invoice once, and wait for
confirmation.

03:45.000 --> 03:54.900
Open the bottle's Owned Stock tab. 24 bottles minus 2 sold leaves 22. Check
Stock History; do not enter the same sale again manually.

03:55.000 --> 04:09.900
Open Dashboard and choose the reporting period. Collections shows money
customers still owe: INR 200 in our example. Older unpaid bills can appear
here too.

04:10.000 --> 04:19.900
The online shop is optional. In Edit Product, check photos and price, then
select Visible in customer catalog and save.

04:20.000 --> 04:29.900
In Company Setup, check Storefront Address and Storefront open to the
public. Choose Save Changes. Storefront Design changes colours, pictures
and layout.

04:30.000 --> 04:39.900
Open Customer View. Check the picture, name and price as a customer would.
Your storefront is your online shop. Share its link when ready.

04:40.000 --> 04:49.900
When AI is enabled, open Tenali AI and choose New chat. Type your question
in everyday words. This example does not send an AI request.

04:50.000 --> 05:00.000
Attach a bill or catalogue using the paperclip. For products, select
Prepare product bulk workbook first. Check AI suggestions before saving
business records.
